claim.claim-text:
a staple inserter (100) and a surgical staple (116);
a group of complementary surgery-specific instruments (68,72,76,80) that are packaged in a sterile state; and
an instrument tray (64) configured to preserve the instruments in the sterile state and provide easy access to the instruments during the surgery.

assembling a group of complementary instruments that are suitable for the surgery;
sterilizing the group of complementary instruments;
configuring an instrument tray suitable to preserve the group of complementary instruments in a sterile state, the instrument tray being configured to provide easy access to the group of complementary instruments during the surgery;
packaging the group of complementary instruments in the sterile state into the instrument tray; and
sealing the instrument tray to preserve the sterile state until the surgery-specific kit is opened during the surgery.
